flowchart TD
    C[Versioned protocol/configuration] --> T[Technical trial]
    T --> RAW[Immutable technical raw record]
    RAW --> PA[Deterministic processing/analysis]
    PA --> TF[Bounded technical findings]

    E[Ethics-approved participant protocol] --> P[Participant task]
    P --> PR[Restricted participant research record]
    PR --> HA[Human analysis]
    HA --> HF[Bounded human findings]

    TF --> SYN[Integrated interpretation]
    HF --> SYN

    RAW -. public reproducibility boundary .-> G[Public Git repository]
    PR -. never committed .-> X[Approved restricted storage]
